ma \/ Western","releaseDate":"2022-11-10","release_date":"2022-11-10","last_modified":"1674074701","rating":"8","rating_5based":"4","backdrop_path":[],"youtube_trailer":"6ocyF_Iuj7U","tmdb":"99346","episode_run_time":"49","category_id":"209","category_ids":[209]},{"num":635,"name":"DE - Peacemaker (US)","series_id":9035,"cover":"https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w154\/hE3LRZAY84fG19a18pzpkZERjTE.jpg","plot":"Die Fortsetzung der Geschichte von Peacemaker - einem \u00fcberzeugend eitlen Mann, der an Frieden um jeden Preis glaubt, egal, wie viele Menschen er daf\u00fcr t\u00f6ten muss - nach den Ereignissen von \"The Suicide Squad\".","cast":"John Cena, Danielle Brooks, Freddie Stroma, Chukwudi Iwuji, Jennifer Holland, Steve Agee, Robert Patrick, Annie Chang","director":"James Gunn","genre":"Action & Adventure \/ Sci-Fi & Fantasy \/ Drama","releaseDate":"2022-01-13","release_date":"2022-01-13","last_modified":"1760534994","rating":"8","rating_5based":"4","backdrop_path":[],"youtube_trailer":"_mrr3UNALww","tmdb":"110492","episode_run_time":"45","category_id":"209","category_ids":[209]},{"num":636,"name":"DE - Munich Games (DE)","series_id":9034,"cover":"https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w154\/ap67kIekmu6HOUt3NBuLyaOjB6j.jpg","plot":"Sechsteilige Serie, die 50 Jahre nach dem M\u00fcnchner Olympia-Attentat spielt - einem traumatischen Terroranschlag auf israelische Athleten im Jahr 1972.","cast":"Seyneb Saleh, Yousef Sweid, Sebastian Rudolph, Doval'e Glickman","director":"","genre":"Drama \/ Krimi","releaseDate":"2022-09-02","release_date":"2022-09-02","last_modified":"1674074173","rating":"6","rating_5based":"3","backdrop_path":[],"youtube_trailer":"BUiwEY_i8ak","tmdb":"156315","episode_run_time":"45","category_id":"209","category_ids":[209]},{"num":637,"name":"DE - Klangor (PL)","series_id":9033,"cover":"https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w154\/9BnHYkAzEPlgsl4nB6oU3cUWYMN.jpg","plot":"In d\u00fcsteren und eindrucksvollen Bildern erz\u00e4hlt die achtteilige polnische Serie die