ci-Fi & Fantasy \/ Action & Adventure","releaseDate":"2023-01-15","release_date":"2023-01-15","last_modified":"1748363317","rating":"9","rating_5based":"4.5","backdrop_path":[],"youtube_trailer":"2Ity_VBjTGo","tmdb":"100088","episode_run_time":"0","category_id":"209","category_ids":[209]},{"num":640,"name":"DE - Inside Man (US)","series_id":9012,"cover":"https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w154\/7tZONSnzKylgzHJvtoOGjRmYlgU.jpg","plot":"Die Handlung folgt einem britischen Insassen einer US-amerikanischen Todeszelle, ein Vikar in einer englischen Kleinstadt sowie ein Lehrer f\u00fcr Mathematik, die auf ungew\u00f6hnliche Weise in ein und dieselbe Geschichte verstrickt sind.","cast":"David Tennant, Stanley Tucci, Dolly Wells, Lydia West, Lyndsey Marshal, Louis Oliver, Atkins Estimond, Dylan Baker","director":"Steven Moffat","genre":"Drama \/ Krimi \/ Mystery","releaseDate":"2022-09-26","release_date":"2022-09-26","last_modified":"1673892617","rating":"7","rating_5based":"3.5","backdrop_path":[],"youtube_trailer":"Pgf_EOX7Q8A","tmdb":"121710","episode_run_time":"60","category_id":"209","category_ids":[209]},{"num":641,"name":"DE - Willow (US)","series_id":9011,"cover":"https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w154\/jhdSPDlhswjN1r6O0pGP3ZvQgU8.jpg","plot":"Jahre nach den Ereignissen des urspr\u00fcnglichen \"Willow\"-Films f\u00fchrt diese Serie v\u00f6llig neue Charaktere in das verzauberte Reich der Feenk\u00f6niginnen und zweik\u00f6pfigen Eborsisk-Monster ein und hei\u00dft die namensgebende Heldin Willow Ufgood wieder willkommen.","cast":"Warwick Davis, Ellie Bamber, Ruby Cruz, Dempsey Bryk, Erin Kellyman, Amer Chadha-Patel, Tony Revolori, Joanne Whalley","director":"Jonathan Kasdan","genre":"Sci-Fi & Fantasy \/ Action & Adventure \/ Drama","releaseDate":"2022-11-30","release_date":"2022-11-30","last_modified":"1673892229","rating":"7","rating_5based":"3.5","backdrop_path":[],"youtube_trailer":"fuOMZkRHTHI","tmdb":"111837","episode_run_time":"50","category_id":"209","category_id