der Regel guckte einer der beiden nach der Pointe perplex oder einfach bl\u00f6d in die Kamera, wozu eine Kapelle einen schiefen Klang ert\u00f6nen lie\u00df. Zum Ritual der Show geh\u00f6rte es, dass die beiden Hauptdarsteller in der Atmosph\u00e4re einer pl\u00fcschigen Bar auftraten und das Saalpublikum begr\u00fc\u00dften und am Ende auch verabschiedeten, obwohl sie dort keinen einzigen Sketch live auff\u00fchrten \u2013 diese waren alle gefilmt.","cast":"","director":"","genre":"Kom\u00f6die","releaseDate":"1984-09-24","release_date":"1984-09-24","last_modified":"1646209762","rating":"8","rating_5based":"4","backdrop_path":null,"youtube_trailer":"","tmdb":"66513","episode_run_time":"28","category_id":"209","category_ids":[209]},{"num":799,"name":"DE - South Park (1997) (US)","series_id":6227,"cover":"https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w600_and_h900_bestv2\/xJnbMTrJ2fl1AXAKx34U4BPvOhs.jpg","plot":"Die Serie konzentriert sich haupts\u00e4chlich auf die Abenteuer der vier Kinder Stan Marsh, Kyle Broflovski, Eric Cartman und Kenny McCormick in der fiktionalen Kleinstadt South Park in den Rocky Mountains in den USA der Gegenwart. Neben den vier Hauptcharakteren wird die Stadt von einer Reihe von zus\u00e4tzlichen Charakteren bev\u00f6lkert.","cast":"Trey Parker, Matt Stone, Mona Marshall, Jennifer Howell","director":"Trey Parker, Matt Stone","genre":"Animation \/ Kom\u00f6die","releaseDate":"1997-08-13","release_date":"1997-08-13","last_modified":"1762088613","rating":"8","rating_5based":"4","backdrop_path":["https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w1280\/1RnTRQEi1LHWulyd1O1ji4QHKhn.jpg","https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w1280\/56HL5PFh6Wy9UPhEUIE55T4mdUe.jpg","https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w1280\/wMbyBgyzhn2eAAt8z9SUcRZVKTJ.jpg","https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w1280\/41neXsH222hV2zrsTyw8h7javon.jpg","https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w1280\/7uihCghJiyYFTXSh1BOPdHQN8xK.jpg"],"youtube_trailer":"uLrlLDLJpMo","tmdb":"2190","episode_run_time":"22","category_id":"209","category_ids":[209]},{"num":800,"name":"DE - Suburgatory (US)","series_id":6228,"cover":"https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w154\/tJ6rU9LZ6SSigvJF5P4sot0T8V3.jpg","plot":"Der alleinerziehende Vater George will nur das Beste f\u00fcr  seine 16-j\u00e4hrige Tochter Tessa. Als er eine Packung Kondome  auf ihrem Nachttisch findet, ergreift er resolute Ma\u00dfnahmen. Fluchtartig  verl\u00e4sst er New York City, um Tessa vor dem sch\u00e4dlichen Einfluss der  Gro\u00dfstadt zu bewahren. In einem friedlichen Vorort soll seine Tochter zu  einer verantwortungsvollen jungen Dame heranreifen. Doch f\u00fcr Tessa ist  der Anblick der neuen Kunststoff-Welt \u2013 inklusive \u00fcbertrieben gepflegter  Rasenfl\u00e4chen und mit Hilfe plastischer Chirurgie \u00fcppig ausgestatteter  Nachbarinnen \u2013 ein Grauen.","cast":"","director":"Emily Kapnek","genre":"Kom\u00f6die","releaseDate":"2011-09-28","release_date":"2011-09-28","last_modified":"1646210395","rating":"7","rating_5based":"3.5","backdrop_path":null,"youtube_trailer":"","tmdb":"39357","episode_run_time":"30","category_id":"209","category_ids":[209]},{"num":801,"name":"DE - Swagger (US)","series_id":6229,"cover":"https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w154\/hmz9rndn6FfN0sN9wuXt17pshNj.jpg","plot":"Inspiriert von den Erfahrungen des NBA-Superstars Kevin Durant beleuchtet \u201eSwagger\u201c die Welt des Jugendbasketballs und die Spieler, ihre Familien und Trainer, die sich auf dem schmalen Grat zwischen Tr\u00e4umen und Ehrgeiz, Opportunismus und Korruption bewegen. Die Serie zeigt auch das Leben abseits des Platzes und wie es ist, in Amerika aufzuwachsen.","cast":"","director":"Reggie Rock Bythewood","genre":"Drama","releaseDate":"2021-10-29","release_date":"2021-10-29","last_modified":"1646210642","rating":"8","rating_5based":"4","backdrop_path":null,"youtube_trailer":"","tmdb":"94245","episode_run_time":"56","category_id":"209","category_ids":[209]},{"num":802,"name":"DE - The Capture (GB)","series_id":6230,"cover":"https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w154\/3JDXPHPxX5ugSNLy6yNEpSSP4Qf.jpg","plot":"Als die Verurteilung des Soldaten Shaun Emery f\u00fcr einen Mord in Afghanistan aufgrund fehlerhafter Videobeweise aufgehoben wird, kehrt er mit seiner kleinen Tochter als freier Mann ins Leben zur\u00fcck. Doch als vernichtendes Videomaterial von einer Nacht in London ans Licht kommt, nimmt Shauns Leben eine schockierende Wendung und er muss bald wieder f\u00fcr seine Freiheit k\u00e4mpfen.","cast":"","director":"Ben Chanan","genre":"Krimi, Drama","releaseDate":"2019-09-03","release_date":"2019-09-03","last_modified":"1646210707","rating":"8","rating_5based":"4","backdrop_path":null,"youtube_trailer":"","tmdb":"93166","episode_run_time":"56","category_id":"209","category_ids":[209]},{"num":803,"name":"DE - Undercover (US)","series_id":6233,"cover":"https:\/\/image.tmdb.org\/t\/p\/w154\/1tq8ao1v28f6DpNfUVMKyiruBwl.jpg","plot":"K.C. Cooper, a high school math whiz and karate black-belt, learns that her parents are spies when they recruit her to join them in the secret government agency, The Organization. While she now has the latest spy gadgets at her disposal, K.C. has a lot to learn about being a spy, including keeping her new gig a secret from her best friend Marisa. Together, K.C. and her parents, Craig and Kira, and her younger siblings, Ernie and Judy (a humanoid robot), try to balance everyday family life while on undercover missions, near and far, to save the world.","cast":"","director":"Corinne Marshall","genre":"Kids, Comedy, Family, Drama","releaseDate":"2015-01-18","release_date":"2015-01-18","last_modified":"1646211228","rating":"8","rating_5based":"4","backdrop_path":null,"youtube_trailer":"","tmdb":"61915","episode_run_time":"25","category_id":"209","category_ids":[209]},{"num":804,"name":"DE - Hidden Agenda","series_id":6234,"cover":"http:\/\/icon-tmdb.me\/stalker_portal\/screenshots\/114\/11313.jpg","plot":"","cast":"","director":"","genre":"","releaseDate":"","release_date":"","last_modified"